# 62, 77, 89. The motivating corpus program, end to end

test refinement-corpus-refined-checks-nir {bench/refined-checks.bot: check calls web::emailish? once and web::uri_query_value? once; the repeat is a constant} -body {
    set hir [refinedChecksSourceHir]
